====Adjective====
{{en-adj|-}}

# [[final|Final]], [[ultimate]], coming after all others of its kind.
#: {{ux|en|&ldquo;Eyes Wide Shut&rdquo; was the '''last''' film to be directed by Stanley Kubrick.}}
