From {{der|en|enm|lasten}}, from {{der|en|ang|lǣstan}}, from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*laistijan}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*laistijaną}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|leisten||yield}}.

